{'k':'R4','ti':'Reading Part 4','ins':'Metinden beş cümle çıkarıldı. Her boşluk için uygun cümleyi (A–H) seç. Üç cümle fazladır.','title':'A school with no homework',
 'p':'Last year, Westfield School stopped giving homework to students under fourteen. The head teacher, Mr Collins, says the decision was not easy. (1) ______ But after reading many studies, he decided to try it.\nInstead of homework, students now spend the last hour of the school day on projects. (2) ______ Teachers are there to help if anyone gets stuck.\nParents had mixed feelings at the start. (3) ______ Others were happy that family evenings were less stressful.\nAfter one year, the results are interesting. Exam results have stayed the same. (4) ______ Students say they feel less tired and more interested in learning.\nThe school will continue the experiment for another two years. (5) ______ If the results are still positive, other schools in the area may follow.',
 's':[('A','Some were worried that their children would fall behind.'),('B','Many teachers were afraid that students would learn less.'),('C','They can choose what to work on, and they often work in small groups.'),('D','However, the number of students who say they enjoy school has gone up.'),('E','During this time, researchers will collect more information.'),('F','Homework is still compulsory for older students at weekends.'),('G','The students wrote a letter to the newspaper about it.'),('H','Exam results fell sharply in the first term.')],
 'a':['B','C','A','D','E'],'tg':['coherence','coherence','reference','linkers-contrast-purpose','reference'],
 'e':['Karar kolay değildi çünkü öğretmenler endişeliydi; "But after reading many studies" ile devam ediyor: B.','Projelerle ilgili ayrıntı; "Teachers are there to help": C.','"Some ... Others ..." yapısı: A.','Sınav sonuçları aynı kaldı; "However" ile olumlu fark: D (H çelişir).','"During this time" = iki yıllık süre: E.']},

{'k':'R5','ti':'Reading Part 5','ins':'Metni oku ve her boşluk için doğru kelimeyi seç.','title':'The village festival',
 'p':'Every summer, our village (1) ______ a festival to raise money for the local school. It started in 1985 and it has become more popular (2) ______ year. This year more than two thousand people came, (3) ______ the weather was cold and cloudy. There were lots of (4) ______ for children, including face painting and a treasure hunt. My favourite part was the music competition, which was (5) ______ by a local band. We raised over five thousand pounds, which will be (6) ______ on new computers for the school.',
 'o':[(['holds','takes','makes','gives'],0,['vocab']),(['all','every','each other','whole'],1,['vocab']),(['despite','however','even though','because'],2,['linkers-contrast-purpose']),(['activities','activity','actions','acts'],0,['countable-uncountable']),(['won','beaten','earned','gained'],0,['passive-voice']),(['spent','paid','bought','used'],0,['passive-advanced'])],
 'e':['hold a festival: festival düzenlemek.','every year: her yıl.','even though + cümle: -mesine rağmen (despite + isim alır).','lots of + çoğul sayılabilir isim: activities.','win a competition: yarışmayı kazanmak (pasif: was won).','spend money on something: bir şeye para harcamak (pasif: will be spent on).']},

